[W-RECEIVER-NOT-FIRST] Warning: `Meter.scale` takes a `Meter` but not as its first parameter, so `m.scale` and `m |> Meter.scale` won't work
   ╭─[ reject/dot-receiver-later.sw:8:5 ]
