 8 │ def Meter.scale (k: Nat) (m: Meter): Meter := { v = k * m.v }
   │     ─────┬─────  
   │          ╰─────── `m: Meter` comes after another parameter
   │ 
   │ Note: put the main value first (`m`), then the other arguments, then any functions; or, for a helper not meant to be called with `.` or `|>`, mark it `@[noReceiver]`
───╯
